  "description": "<p>When using MySQL concurrent updates to the search index still deadlock.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>WARN 08:41:47.316 [qtp1923962747-33] (WildcardExceptionMapper) Unmapped exceptionorg.springframework.dao.DeadlockLoserDataAccessException: PreparedStatementCallback; SQL [INSERT INTO search_resource_rdf_type (resource_id, rdf_type_id) SELECT a.resource_id, b.rdf_type_id FROM  (SELECT id AS resource_id FROM simple_search WHERE fedora_id = ?) a, (SELECT id AS rdf_type_id from search_rdf_type WHERE rdf_type_uri= ?) b]; (conn=6) Deadlock found when trying to get lock; try restarting transaction; nested exception is java.sql.BatchUpdateException: (conn=6) Deadlock found when trying to get lock; try restarting transaction\tat org.springframework.jdbc.support.SQLErrorCodeSQLExceptionTranslator.doTranslate(SQLErrorCodeSQLExceptionTranslator.java:271)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.support.AbstractFallbackSQLExceptionTranslator.translate(AbstractFallbackSQLExceptionTranslator.java:70)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate.translateException(JdbcTemplate.java:1541)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate.execute(JdbcTemplate.java:667)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate.execute(JdbcTemplate.java:691)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate.batchUpdate(JdbcTemplate.java:1034)\tat org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam.NamedParameterJdbcTemplate.batchUpdate(NamedParameterJdbcTemplate.java:373)\tat org.fcrepo.search.impl.DbSearchIndexImpl.insertRdfTypeAssociations(DbSearchIndexImpl.java:700)\tat org.fcrepo.search.impl.DbSearchIndexImpl.doDirectUpsert(DbSearchIndexImpl.java:557)\tat org.fcrepo.search.impl.DbSearchIndexImpl.lambda$addUpdateIndex$1(DbSearchIndexImpl.java:542)\tat org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.TransactionImpl.doInTx(TransactionImpl.java:190)\tat org.fcrepo.search.impl.DbSearchIndexImpl.addUpdateIndex(DbSearchIndexImpl.java:538)\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
